        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/starkenburg_alexander/{size}/1857_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-07-20T15:53:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I may be reading too much into this, as I previously did with the \"Who bailed out BB from MMFFCC?\", but my theory is, which I think they have pretty firmly \"confirmed\":</p><p><br>A. BB helps Shrieker become MM. He \"got what he wanted out of the agreement\" in the love in the multiverse episode, which&nbsp;(to me) indicates hanky-panky, and what would BB want with just plain ol lovin' he could get from any of the many adoring Mordengradian ladies? He would want a powerful <em>offsping</em>.</p><p><br>B. BB later gets trapped in MMFFCC, presumably by one of the later, not-Shrieker MMs, but maybe it is Shrieker, the theory still works. \"A mysterious figure\" bargains for his release. Who better than his son/daughter, who has both a connection to BB AND MMFFCC?</p><p>Whoops, almost forgot this! *Puts on a tinfoil hat*<br><br>~Komori</p>",
