      {
        "id": 219871,
        "name": "liarliar",
        "username": "liarliar",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/liarliar/{size}/1951_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-04T08:10:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The way I see it playing out:<br>*Knyfe and Haka know each other through superheroing. They flirt, but nothing serious.<br>*The Progeny event happens. Paige leaves Earth to hunt it down. (I think it's canon that she has some brief relationships with aliens in this time?)<br>*Cosmic Contest. Progeny gets ripped up real good. Paige returns to Earth.<br>*Pre-Oblivaeon stuff gets underway. They have a bit more time to flirt.<br>*Stuff starts to get Real.<br>*(They bang).<br>*There is at least one Serious Conversation about Feelings. Paige isn't totally sure where she stands, Aata respects that but thinks they have something that could last and wants to give it a proper, serious go. There's potential there. This could happen.</p><p>And then Oblivaeon happens and, iirc, our Haka ends up in the universe where our Knyfe is dead, and the shippers weep.</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:52:15.955Z",
