      {
        "id": 219872,
        "name": "Under3",
        "username": "Under3",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/under3/{size}/1872_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-04T11:12:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can totally see Haka just enjoying a bit of sex here and there for what it is. He’s an immortal being that clearly has a huge enjoyment of life and accepts the transitory nature of his connections with others.<br>\nI’m not sure it’s that unbelievable that Haka and KNYFE could have just had a bit of fun (it certainly seems to be her m.o.).<br>\nI can see him totally enjoying any experience with another and being fine with whatever length of time it is.<br>\nI’m not sure he’d even see that much difference between “strings” and “no strings” they way we might, both are just temporary to him anyway.</p>",
