        "username": "Ehkrickor",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ehkrickor/{size}/2035_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-20T17:13:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Went back and listened to this episode again on my drive home from vacation. And I realized that the Majority of my questions that C&amp;A have answered have wound up with a sad moment for Aata. I guess that's what happens when you live that long. Grandpa used to say Y\"ou know your'e old when life starts taking your lifelong friends,\" and… that never really ends for Haka…</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\">  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\"></p>",
